This week in Linear

Cycle insights
Every completed cycle now gets a summary: planned vs. shipped, scope added mid-cycle, and the issues that carried over. Compare cycles side by side.

Sub-team views
Large teams can define sub-teams with their own views and triage without splitting the issue database.

Linear for Sales
A lightweight view for account teams: see the status of every customer-linked issue without a full Linear seat. Included with Business plans.

Also shipped: Asks in Slack now supports threads as issues, and the Notion integration embeds issue lists in pages.

Full changelog: https://linear.app/changelog/2026-03-24

